    "UIName": "Tian Xie Zuo",
    "Id": "chassisdef_tian_xie_zuo_TXZ-Prime",
    "Name": "Tian Xie Zuo",
    "Details": "The primary configuration combines the long range direct firepower of two Improved Heavy Gauss rifles and two Large ER Pulse with two MML-9 launchers. Two Medium Pulse Lasers and two LB-X AC/2 provide secondary fire as needed. Using a multi-track capable Fire Control System allows the design to engage multiple targets at once, spreading its damage potential even further.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Ballistics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.36</color></b>",
